	(text "SPEC.md 12/13, DECISIONS.md D020/D022. Isolated CAN (ISO1042DWR), USB-C 2.0 FS device, SWD debug, status LEDs, board connector bank. CAN topology ported from PALTA pcb_design/CAN.sch (ISO1050 -> ISO1042, D022)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "63e4dd66-bd13-47d6-8554-d78334add583")
	)
	(text "ISOLATED CAN: CAN_5V/CAN_GND come from the aux sheet's NXE2S0505MC (3 kVDC, functional isolation; reinforced barrier budget sits in the HV-facing devices).\nLegacy CAN.sch reverse-polarity FET (2N7002+MBR0540 on the external 5 V feed) dropped - supply is on-board now. TVS added: legacy sheet's own note flags\nmissing overvoltage protection. ISO1042 pinout verified vs TI SLLSF09E: 1 VCC1, 2/8 GND1, 3 TXD, 5 RXD, 9/10/15 GND2, 11/16 VCC2 (external tie), 12 CANL,\n13 CANH, 4/6/7/14 NC. VCC1 = +3.3 V (1.71-5.5 V OK)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 46.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "043322b8-8c2b-4ef8-a39c-1800263b545a")
	)
