	(text "USB 2.0 FS device (VESC tool). USB is user-accessible: the reinforced barrier is UPSTREAM - the whole control domain is separated from HV by the gate-driver /\nAMC1311 / HOYS / ISO1042 barriers (SPEC 5, D017/D022) - so no extra isolation here. USBLC6-2SC6 pinout (SOT-23-6): 1 I/O1, 2 GND, 3 I/O2, 4 I/O2, 5 VBUS,\n6 I/O1 - verified vs ST datasheet / official KiCad symbol. VBUS sensed only (self-powered device): 47k/22k -> 1.59 V at 5 V -> USB_VBUS_SENSE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 110.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
